Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source is vendored in this repository.

Until 2026-09-22 a second Flutter app lived under `client_flutter/` and was
derived from the "restaurant finder" sample in Google's genui repository
(Copyright 2024 Google LLC, Apache 2.0). That app has been removed in full
(spec `specs/repo/0002-retire-the-client-flutter-app.md`). The A2UI client in
`frontend/` was written from scratch and derives nothing from that sample: it
carries no Google copyright headers and does not depend on the genui packages
(`genui`, `genui_a2a`, `a2ui_core`) — a decision recorded in
`specs/frontend/0002-a2ui-agent-path.md` OD-1, because this service streams
render intents rather than A2UI component trees. The attribution above is
therefore retired with the code it covered; the Git history keeps it, as the
licence expects.

The backend speaks Google's A2A protocol. A protocol implementation is not
vendored source and is governed by its own dependencies' licences.
